The names "Operation Exile" and "Operation Exile: Casino", associated logos, branding, and original project identity are not licensed for use as the branding of an independent derivative release except to provide factual attribution such as "Based on Operation Exile: Casino".

A Derivative Workshop Release should use its own name and branding unless separate written permission is granted by CtrlQuest / Operation Exile.

Original visual assets supplied with the Project may be modified for your own server. Redistribution of those original assets as part of a Derivative Workshop Release is permitted only to the extent necessary for a Meaningful Retexture and subject to this License and any third-party rights identified in THIRD_PARTY_LICENSES.md.

